<title>USA: Transcom Intl gets NASDAQ listing.</title>
<headline>Transcom Intl gets NASDAQ listing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transcom International Ltd said on Wednesday it had received approval for listing on NASDAQ, effective on September 30, under the symbol &quot;TRIXY.&quot;</p>
<p>Transcom International is a technology development company with core expertise in the design and manufacture of proprietary electronic control systems.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
